  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kunskapsproduktion om centrala fr&#xE5;gor i EAC:s integrationsprocess: oj&#xE4;mlikheter ssk r&#xF6;rande tillg&#xE5;ng t utbildning och arbetsmarknad, samt spridande av kunskap om dessa dimensioner via media, debatter och m&#xF6;ten med politiker, tj&#xE4;nstem&#xE4;n, akademin och civsamh.     Refer also to other contributions through the Kenya team.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">realisation of a regional integration process that is fair, equitable and pro-poor through knowledge production and debate with relevant stakeholders in four areas: 1) equity in the Eastern African regional integration process; 2) equity in employment opportunity and labour market structure in the context of regional integration; 3) equity in education opportunities 4, mainstreaming equity in media</narrative>
  </description>
